WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.612
MAID Exterminator Tracing.

00:00:02.562 --> 00:00:09.187
46 currently sitting Members of Parliament signed off on BOTH Bill C-14 and Bill C-7.

00:00:09.187 --> 00:00:13.787
They legalized MAID and then expanded it to non-terminal conditions.

00:00:13.787 --> 00:00:18.250
76,707 Canadians are dead.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:21.850
The UN has called for Track 2 to be repealed.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.112
10 provinces oppose further expansion.

00:00:25.112 --> 00:00:27.912
These MPs are still in power.
